Predefined Variables:
.list
$File - Current file
$View - Current view
$Date - Current date
$Time - Current time
.end

.h2 Troubleshooting

.h3 Common Errors

"file not found"
.list
Check file path and name
Ensure file exists in current directory or plugin directory
.end

"[variable is undefined]"
.list
Variable not set with .set
Check variable name spelling
Use \$variable to escape variable references
.end

"[Error evaluating $$function()]"
.list
Function not defined
Check function name spelling
Ensure function is properly defined with .func
.end

"Missing .end"
.list
Function or block not properly closed
Add .end to close function definition
.end

.h3 Debugging Tips
.list
Use .debug to see processing steps
Check variable values with .debug
Verify file paths are correct
Test functions individually
Check syntax for missing .end
.end

.h3 Performance

.list
Large files: Process in chunks
Complex functions: Optimize logic
Many variables: Use instance variables
Frequent processing: Consider caching
.end

.h3 Best Practices
.list
Organize code with mixins for reusability
Use meaningful names for variables and functions
Comment complex logic with .comment
Test incrementally as you build
Keep functions simple and focused
Use consistent formatting for readability
.end

